[I] Tool to manipulate the UEFI Secure Boot Machine Owner Key list

[T] mokutil is the utility to manipulate the Machine Owner Key (MOK) list, as
[T] managed by shim's built-in UEFI Secure Boot MOK manager, allowing users to
[T] enroll or delete custom certificates and keys used to validate kernels and
[T] drivers.

[U] https://github.com/lcp/mokutil

[A] Gary Ching-Pang Lin <glin@suse.com>
